      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the trust policy and the execution role seems fine, it definitely has this policy attached. i also checked the bucket policy too. actually, i just noticed that i'm also getting errors when the lambda tries to do a `s3:ListBucket` on the root of the bucket, not just the objects. i added `s3:ListBucket` to my policy but it still fails. could you look at the resource ARN part of the policy for that? i might be doing something wrong with the way i'm targeting the bucket vs the objects.",
