      "content": "You need to separate the permissions for the bucket itself from the objects; `s3:ListBucket` must target only the bucket ARN (`arn:aws:s3:::my-company-logs`), while `s3:GetObject` targets the object ARNs ending in `/*`. Your current policy likely conflates these, causing the error when listing the bucket. Update your `s3:GetObject` statment to remove the `/*` suffix so it grants access to all objects without conflicting with the bucket-level permission.",
